WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
File Handi. Ideal for Patients with Limited Opening. Adapter for latch grip rotary files also available.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.833
Pen grip. Brace the round handle in the palm.

3
00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.917
Overhand grip. Hold the bare shaft from above.

4
00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:08.750
Collar position. Seat the collar just behind the shaft seam.

5
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.333
Insert the file. Loosen the nut. Seat the file handle.

6
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:13.667
Secure the file. Tighten the knurled nut.

7
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.500
Watch winding. Roll the front shank back and forth.

8
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Illustrative gearing. The shank drives the barrel through the 90° head.

9
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.250
Barrel and file. Both reverse with each turn of the shank.

10
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:22.250
Release the file. Loosen the nut and withdraw the file.

11
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.250
Adapter for latch grip rotary files also available.
